    "bio": "A Representative from Oregon; born in The Dalles, Wasco County, Ore., January 10, 1957; B.S., University of Oregon, Eugene, Ore., 1981; member of the Oregon state house of representatives, 1989-1995; member of the Oregon state senate, 1995-1997; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred Sixth and to the ten succeeding Congresses (January 3, 1999-January 3, 2021); chair, Committee on Energy &amp; Commerce (One Hundred Fifteenth Congress); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Seventeenth Congress in 2020.",
